# Everything is state, and none of it is a secret.
#
# .terraform/ holds downloaded providers: a few hundred megabytes of binaries
# that belong in a cache, not in a repository.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
tfplan

# A .tfvars file is where a real deployment would put its own values. The file
# in this directory is meant to be read. What must never be committed is a file
# holding an actual secret value, which is why CRON_SECRET and KV_REDIS_URL are
# not variables here at all: they are referenced by Secret name only.
*.auto.tfvars